; Room 58 ($3A): The Beach
;
; Format: see #R$C000.
; .
; Border: red (2). Conveyor: moves Willy left, 5 cells from row 15 column 0.
; Ramp: 1 cells from row 14 column 5 up to row 14 column 5, rising to the
; right.
; .
; Items (from the item table at #R$A400): 2, at row 13 columns 22, 22.
; .
; Exits: left Room 59 (The Yacht, #R$FB00); right Room 51 (Tool  Shed,
; #R$F300); up Room 58 (The Beach, #R$FA00); down Room 0 (The Off Licence,
; #R$C000). Odd: the up exit leads back to this room.
; .
; Entities: slot 0: definition $01 (at $A008) start $0E; slot 1: definition
; $3C (at $A1E0) start $54. List ends at slot 2 ($FF).
@label=RoomBeach
b$FA00 DEFB $00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00 ; row 0: ................................
 $FA08 DEFB $00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00 ; row 1: ................................
